11
01:09:40,000 --> 01:09:46,000
Fear Island is a 2009 Canadian mystery-thriller film directed by Michael Storey
and starring Aaron Ashmore, Haylie Duff, Lucy Hale and Kyle Schmid.

12
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
The film follows five student friends partying on a remote island, when they
find a dead body and encounter a killer who wants them all dead.

13
01:22:20,000 --> 01:22:26,000
Fear Island was released direct-to-video on September 8, 2009, in
Canada and on June 28, 2010, in the United States.

14
01:28:40,000 --> 01:28:46,000
The tone is mind_bending and dark and intense.
